      "settings": {
        "eyebrow": "",
        "heading": "Who We Are",
        "body": "<p>Meet Experience (ME) is a digital marketing and technology agency based in Shanghai and part of <a href=\"https://www.meetsocial.com/\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://www.meetsocial.com/\">Meetsocial Group</a>, a global marketing technology group founded in Shanghai in 2013. We draw on the group’s experience helping Chinese businesses connect with international customers.</p><p>ME works with businesses in Singapore, Hong Kong, Taiwan and beyond, supporting local growth and international expansion. Our core services include website design and development, SEO and AI SEO, affiliate marketing, and email marketing.</p><p>We connect strategy, technical implementation and ongoing optimization to help businesses build their online presence, attract new customers and strengthen customer relationships. Each engagement is shaped around the client’s goals, target markets and stage of growth.</p>",
